            "body": "Checked: no effect. `'startofline'` only governs a fixed list of commands (`CTRL-D/U/B/F`, `G`, `H`, `M`, `L`, `gg`, linewise `d`/`<<`/`==`/`>>`, `%` with a count, buffer-changing commands, line-number-only Ex commands) — `j`/`k`/`gj`/`gk` aren't among them, they always try to preserve `curswant`. Different mechanism, not in play here.",
